196018Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10240663816, 'load_duration': 32605668, 'prompt_eval_count': 575, 'prompt_eval_duration': 443853550, 'eval_count': 513, 'eval_duration': 9763288692, 'model_name': 'granite-code:20b'} id='run--e2437b29-6d00-44a1-8389-63354a051a0a-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 575, 'output_tokens': 513, 'total_tokens': 1088}
