Task 1: Restore etcd - get all nodes
Description Task 1: This task retrieves the names of all the nodes in the RKE2 cluster by running a kubectl command. The output is then stored in the 'node_names' variable.

Task 2: Restore etcd - remove old nodes
Description Task 2: This task removes any nodes from the RKE2 cluster that are not present in the current inventory (groups[rke2_cluster_group_name]). It uses the 'node_names' variable obtained in the previous task to compare with the current inventory and remove any unnecessary nodes.


